&lt;p style="margin-left: 96px; line-height: 12px; margin-right: 0px; text-align: left"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 96px; line-height: 18px; margin-right: 0px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;(4) 回収可能価額の算定方法&lt;/p&gt;
